  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ae309fc9b93c4434b888290b1d747f9a, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::TeacherInteraction
  playerMovement: {fileID: 0}
  teacherName: Brown
  dialoguePopUp: {fileID: 1256853252}
  dialogueManager: {fileID: 1682790333}
  spellSelectionScreen: {fileID: 0}
  battleScreen: {fileID: 0}
  element: 
  totalNumOfElementSpells: 0
  battleCanvas: {fileID: 0}
  eventSystem: {fileID: 0}
  initalLines:
  - Come in, come in!
  - "I\u2019m Ms. Brown. Nice to meet you."
  - "I see you\u2019ve come to master water, one of the most diverse and strongest
    elements in my opinion."
  - Lucky for you, I have just the task to help you get started. See those walls
    of ice over there?
  - Try turning them to water. Then try taming some sea creatures using the water.
  - But beware! The tide will be slightly off, so make sure to correct it before
    calling creatures from the deep.
  - "Come back once you\u2019re successful."
  afterPuzzleLines:
  - Wonderful job, wonderful job!
  - It seems you are prepared for a harder test. Shall we start?
  afterBattleLines:
  - Water is a diverse discipline.
  - "You\u2019re sure to find a specialty in it. Here, take this spell."
  afterSpellLines:
  - "Don\u2019t be afraid of the depths."
  - We often fear what is unknown, but it is only by conquering those fears can we
    push the limits.
